OL,3,CHow do wildfires happen? Experts
OL,4,Cexplain the risks
OL,6,FThere's been a large increase in
OL,7,Fwildfires across Devon and Somerset
OL,8,Fduring the recent period of hot
OL,9,Fweather, as experts warn people to
OL,10,Ftake extra care to reduce the risk.
OL,12,FDevon and Somerset Fire and Rescue had
OL,13,Fits busiest month for emergency calls
OL,14,Fin the last ten years in July,
OL,15,Fattending more than 750 fires, two-
OL,16,Fthirds of which were outdoors.
OL,18,FMany of these fires have been in
OL,19,Fwoodland and standing crops.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
