OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F404A1786097899
OL,3,CHow do wildfires happen? Experts
OL,4,Cexplain the risks
OL,6,FEarlier this week, emergency crews
OL,7,Ftackled a large wildfire on a cliff
OL,8,Fedge in Cornwall.
OL,10,FThe gorse fire on North Cliffs near
OL,11,FPortreath burned overnight, with
OL,12,Ffirefighters using hose reels and
OL,13,Fbeaters to extinguish it.
OL,15,FWhat increases the risk of wildfires?
OL,17,FTim Parish, a National Park Ranger in
OL,18,FExmoor National Park, said conditions
OL,19,Fare so dry people need to take extra
OL,20,Fcare with routine activities like
OL,21,Fparking a car.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
