PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F404A1786097899
OL,3,CHow do wildfires happen? Experts
OL,4,Cexplain the risks
OL,6,F"Parking your car on long grass can
OL,7,Fcause the hot exhaust to ignite," he
OL,8,Fsaid.
OL,10,FHe adds that a bonfire or BBQ in a
OL,11,Fgarden can very quickly "get out of
OL,12,Fcontrol" as the undergrowth is so dry,
OL,13,Fand warns against the use of camping
OL,14,Fstoves or cigarettes.
OL,16,FWhat makes green spaces at risk of
OL,17,Fwildfires?
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
