FL,405,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F404A1786097899
OL,3,CHow do wildfires happen? Experts
OL,4,Cexplain the risks
OL,6,FExmoor is also famous for its slopes,
OL,7,Fand because fires tend to travel
OL,8,Fuphill, wildfires can "build momentum".
OL,10,F"Gorse burns insanely hot and insanely
OL,11,Fquickly", he says.
OL,13,FMr Parish says all of this is why the
OL,14,Fupland landscape of Exmoor is
OL,15,Fespecially dangerous, leading him to
OL,16,Fwarn people to take extra care when
OL,17,Foutdoors.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/5
